{!Contact.FirstName},

I am reviewing accounts that are at risk for being sent to our litigation team for evaluation  and wanted to reach out to see if we can come to an agreement to resolve your account. We would like to work together and discuss a payment plan moving forward to get the contract out of legal default.

Please let me know if you are willing to discuss a possible resolution. If we are unable to discuss we will have to move forward to enforce the contract send to our litigation team to review, which may may result in a lawsuit against both you and the business.

Thank you,

{!Case.Case_Email_Signature_Name_Formula__c}

National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of
Quick Bridge Funding, LLC

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
